{"claims":[{"claim_text":"Anyone currently receiving Social Security, or close to being eligible for it, will not be impacted by any changes.", "claim_types":["policy_position"], "evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"Key changes to Social Security should merit bipartisan agreement so any reforms will be a win for the American people rather than a political victory for any one party.", "claim_types":["policy_position"], "evidence_ids":[2]},{"claim_text":"Real reform of Social Security does not require, and will not include, tax increases.", "claim_types":["policy_position"], "evidence_ids":[3]},{"claim_text":"Personal savings accounts must be the cornerstone of restructuring Social Security.", "claim_types":["policy_position"], "evidence_ids":[4]},{"claim_text":"Each of today's workers should be free to direct a portion of their payroll taxes to personal investments for their retirement future.", "claim_types":["policy_position"], "evidence_ids":[4]},{"claim_text":"Individuals should be offered a variety of investment alternatives and detailed information to help them judge the risks and benefits of each plan.", "claim_types":["policy_position"], "evidence_ids":[4]},{"claim_text":"Today's financial markets offer some investment options that guarantee a rate of return higher than the current Social Security system with no risk to the investor.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"], "evidence_ids":[4]},{"claim_text":"Any new options for retirement security should be voluntary, so workers can choose to remain in the current system or opt for something different.", "claim_types":["policy_position"], "evidence_ids":[5]},{"claim_text":"This challenge demands the kind of presidential leadership the country has not seen in almost a decade.", "claim_types":["evaluation"], "evidence_ids":[6]},{"claim_text":"Governor Bush has shown his commitment by proposing a bold alternative to the collapse of Social Security.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"], "evidence_ids":[6]},{"claim_text":"We pledge to join Governor Bush in the endeavor of saving Social Security.", "claim_types":["policy_position"], "evidence_ids":[6]}],"unresolved_references":[]}
```

